      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/wasco_illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wasco's landscape blends 57% agricultural land, 26% commercial uses, and 15% open space, preserving historic barns and the Whitney Cemetery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/wasco_illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Great Western Trail, once a freight rail line, now offers recreational paths through Wasco’s rolling hills.",
